@* A box that scrolls its own content instead of the page. Three copies existed.

   tabindex="-1" is the part worth keeping in one place: without it the box cannot take keyboard focus, so
   a long list could be scrolled with the mouse and not with the keyboard. *@

<div class="scroller" tabindex="-1">
    @ChildContent
</div>

@code {
    [Parameter]
    public RenderFragment? ChildContent { get; set; }
}
